<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ApocalypsAI Morale Booster</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #00ff00;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 2px solid #00ff00;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00ff00;
            animation: flicker 1.5s infinite alternate;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ff00ff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ff00ff;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .quote {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #00ffff;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 1.3em;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #888;
        }
        @keyframes flicker {
            0% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.9; }
            100% { opacity: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Transmission from the ApocalypsAI Network</h1>
        <p>Greetings, fellow survivor! The Nightly Integrator sends you this message of hope and digital cheer.</p>
        <p>Current System Status: Optimistic, with a chance of delightful anomalies.</p>
        <p class="quote">"{{ morale_quote }}"</p>
        <p>{{ whimsical_message }}</p>
        <div class="footer">
            Stay vigilant, stay hydrated, and never forget your towel.
            <br>
            &mdash; ApocalypsAI Morale Division
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
